WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:08.246
Today shows who still
needs a note.

2
00:00:08.246 --> 00:00:11.920
One tap opens it.

3
00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:26.894
Answer the service plan
by tapping.

4
00:00:26.894 --> 00:00:34.962
Then tap what happened
on the shift.

5
00:00:34.962 --> 00:00:39.331
Tap Write my note. It drafts
from what you tapped.

6
00:00:39.331 --> 00:00:46.032
Read it. Change anything
that is not right.

7
00:00:46.032 --> 00:00:54.099
Type your name, or sign
on the glass.

8
00:00:54.099 --> 00:00:58.064
Signed and locked,
with the time to the minute.

9
00:00:58.064 --> 00:01:02.833
It cannot be edited.
A fix goes on as an addendum.

10
00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:07.767
Then straight on to
the next person.
